Error [jet.SelfOutsideMethod]: `show` takes `self`, but it is not a method
  --> tests/ui/self_param_outside_method_is_e0639.jet:5:10
    |
  5 | show: fn(self: Point) -> Int {
    |          ^^^^
 Why: `self` is the value a method is called on; a function outside a type body or `impl` has no such value, so `self` would silently be an ordinary parameter
 Fix: Move `show` into the type's body or an `impl` block to make it a method, or give the parameter another name
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0639

